# Dropbox app key for the web build (PKCE OAuth, no secret needed).
# Create a "Scoped access" app at https://www.dropbox.com/developers/apps with the
# permissions files.metadata.read, files.content.read, files.content.write, and add
# your site origin (e.g. http://localhost:1420/ and your deployed URL) to the app's
# OAuth 2 redirect URIs. Then copy the App key here.
VITE_DROPBOX_APP_KEY=

# GitHub connection for the web build (optional; independent of Dropbox).
# Create an OAuth App at https://github.com/settings/developers with your site
# URL as the Authorization callback URL, then deploy the token-exchange proxy in
# server/github-oauth-worker/ (it holds the client secret). Set the client id and
# the proxy's URL here. Leave blank to disable GitHub.
VITE_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
VITE_GITHUB_OAUTH_PROXY=
